---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service for ImageTool, a free and private browser-based image toolkit."
  path="/terms"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-6 text-slate-700">
    <header class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3 pb-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase">
        Legal Agreement
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Last updated: November 2026. Please read these terms carefully before using ImageTool.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="p-6 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using ImageTool, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the application. ImageTool is provided free of charge for personal and commercial image processing purposes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2. Ownership and Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">Your Content Belongs to You:</strong> You retain 100% full ownership, copyright, and intellectual property rights to all images, graphics, and photos you process with ImageTool.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because ImageTool operates entirely client-side inside your web browser, we do not host, store, copy, inspect, or claim any license or ownership over any of your source or output images.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3. Permissive AI Model Licenses</h2>
      <p>
        ImageTool deploys only open-source neural network models with verified commercial-friendly licenses:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-700">
        <li><strong>BiRefNet-lite:</strong> Licensed under the MIT License (ZhengPeng7).</li>
        <li><strong>MODNet:</strong> Licensed under the Apache-2.0 License (ZHKKKe).</li>
        <li><strong>Swin2SR:</strong> Licensed under the Apache-2.0 License (mv-lab).</li>
        <li><strong>Real-ESRGAN Compact:</strong> Licensed under the BSD-3-Clause License (xinntao).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You are permitted to use processed results from these models for both personal and commercial projects without royalty obligations to ImageTool.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to use ImageTool in compliance with all applicable local, national, and international laws. You may not use the service to process imagery that infringes third-party copyrights or violates applicable laws.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 bg-[#f8f9fc] rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        ImageTool is provided on an &quot;AS IS&quot; and &quot;AS AVAILABLE&quot; basis, without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. Performance, processing speed, and neural model outputs depend upon your local hardware capabilities, GPU drivers, and browser compatibility.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
